+ * Neither was clamped. A single malformed G_VTX therefore writes up to ~114 KB off the end
+ * of `rsp` and through `rdp`, overwriting `rdp.palette`, `rdp.texture_to_load.addr`,
+ * `rdp.block_addr` and `loaded_texture[].addr` with vertex coordinate data. A later
+ * dereference of one of those faults on an address that is not a pointer at all, which is
+ * the shape of JUNGLE's `fault addr 0x1e80000e45bfc37`.
